# Kipuka EST — CA Trust Chain (RFC 7030 §4.1)
Output docs/gifs/02-est-cacerts.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# EST Trust Chain — kipuka-rsa.cert-lab.local (RFC 7030 §4.1)"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./lab est-cacerts -p rsa"
Enter
Sleep 5s
